  "description": "3.0 x 3.0 m platform, origin at its centre on the deck top. Post pairs at x = -1.5 (twin headstocks; also carries the last deck module's stringer ends), x = 0 (flush) and x = +1.5; posts reach 1.65 m below the deck. Materials: WeatheredTimber, WetTimber, RustyIron. 3,880 triangles.",
  "brief": "Crescent Cove (Holodeck tropical-island) wide jetty end platform per the kit sheet: weathered silver-brown planks with gaps and bolts on five stringers, six round posts (corner posts protruding as mooring posts), headstocks and X braces, algae-stained below the splash line. Sits over knee-deep water at the jetty end.",
